       SSYYNNCC__FFIILLEE__RRAANNGGEE__WWAAIITT__BBEEFFOORREE  and SSYYNNCC__FFIILLEE__RRAANNGGEE__WWAAIITT__AAFFTTEERR will detect
       any I/O errors or EENNOOSSPPCC  conditions  and  will  return  these  to  the
       caller.

