              wait for completion of that operation, and obtain its result.

       SSYYNNCC__FFIILLEE__RRAANNGGEE__WWAAIITT__BBEEFFOORREE || SSYYNNCC__FFIILLEE__RRAANNGGEE__WWRRIITTEE ||
